      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "This is a one year review. A site visit was performed before installation. Installation was on a day where a little rain was expected. All workers were employed directly by the company and are electricians (or apprentice electricians). The faces on the website are who you get. Work was done right up until it we had a bit of a shower. Once cleared installation was finished that day. Installation was very neat (no ugly conduit). All necessary paper work was completed by eSmart. Once installation was completed a folder containing all my necessary documents was provided to me. Only a couple of roof tiles (concrete) were broken, which were replaced by my spares. Once operational I was shown how to use Enphase interface. I had one software problem months later which was rectified a few days later, via remote access.",
