      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Before I started looking for quotes I did a lot of reading on sites such as your and talking to people with systems installed (just wandered the streets of my neighbourhood), all very helpful, once I had an idea of what to look for I started with your site to get some quotes. I found the level of quotation service varied enormously. we have real shading issues and when I requested a site visit, the answer was something like \"are you ready to sign up\". NO come and assure me that my hard earned money is being spent efficiently. I was directed to e-smart solar by my friendly neighbourhood electrician and after contacting them and explaining my concerns, a sit visit was suggested before I asked. Not the cheapest but he won hands down. We have installed 18*LG 330w panels with Solaredge Optomisers and a Solaredge 6kW inverter.",
